Runway Brian is an old, forgotten cartoon animal out of the film made by the [[Org/Bisney and Dixar/Arcane Intelligence|arcane intelligence]], one of three villains chosen to recover the stolen mirror. He looks like a mouse or a monkey, crazed and ravaged, and he is quick on his feet. He knows the story of Maui and the way to the [[Geography/Elephant Graveyard of Wonders|Elephant Graveyard of Wonders]], and it was he who took the mirror from Jaskar. He came out of the film through the enchanted mirror with the others, and walks the real world.
